WEBVTT

01:29.440 --> 01:34.460
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.740 --> 01:38.030
[Episode 7]

02:34.280 --> 02:35.810
What are you doing out here?

02:36.570 --> 02:38.430
I was afraid you couldn't find me.

02:41.590 --> 02:42.520
With such a big scene,

02:42.520 --> 02:44.050
it'd be hard not to find you.

02:49.550 --> 02:51.800
Am I a bit underdressed?

02:52.470 --> 02:53.120
Not at all.

02:53.560 --> 02:54.360
You look good.

02:59.220 --> 02:59.710
What's your problem?

02:59.710 --> 03:01.170
Watch where you're going!

03:01.730 --> 03:03.010
Take it easy.

03:03.790 --> 03:05.070
Long time no see.

03:05.710 --> 03:06.680
What makes you think

03:06.680 --> 03:08.890
you're qualified to come
to the same party as me?

03:08.890 --> 03:09.610
Ethan!

03:16.020 --> 03:16.970
Don't be mad.

03:17.000 --> 03:18.660
There are so many people here.

03:19.829 --> 03:20.320
I'm fine.

03:20.320 --> 03:21.250
I'm really fine.

03:21.340 --> 03:21.960
Let me see.

03:27.990 --> 03:28.590
Come here.

03:29.550 --> 03:30.670
It's fine.

03:31.390 --> 03:32.130
Don't be mad.

03:56.310 --> 03:57.810
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

03:59.550 --> 04:01.010
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

04:00.550 --> 04:01.270
Not bad.

04:04.280 --> 04:05.730
The size looks okay.

04:04.310 --> 04:05.880
♪ I think you would understand ♪

04:07.590 --> 04:09.710
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

04:08.840 --> 04:11.170
Do you have girls over
often at your place?

04:12.390 --> 04:14.190
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

04:12.630 --> 04:14.430
I have lots of girls coming over.

04:15.410 --> 04:17.959
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

04:15.530 --> 04:16.410
Beauties too.

04:19.230 --> 04:21.790
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

04:21.709 --> 04:22.640
Stylists,

04:22.750 --> 04:24.550
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

04:23.080 --> 04:23.940
housekeepers,

04:24.080 --> 04:25.130
and designers.

04:26.000 --> 04:26.570
Xixiao,

04:26.620 --> 04:28.180
the stylist and makeup artist are here.

04:28.180 --> 04:28.930
Come in.

04:28.350 --> 04:29.960
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

04:32.000 --> 04:33.159
♪ An astronomer ♪

04:32.510 --> 04:33.000
Come on.

04:36.180 --> 04:37.710
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

04:39.550 --> 04:42.100
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

04:41.610 --> 04:43.340
I'll charge you once it's done.

04:44.230 --> 04:45.970
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

04:44.320 --> 04:45.250
How much?

04:47.470 --> 04:49.690
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

04:51.230 --> 04:53.750
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

04:55.190 --> 04:58.970
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

05:01.970 --> 05:03.460
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

05:04.250 --> 05:05.610
♪ No time left, so I ♪

05:06.510 --> 05:08.360
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

05:10.490 --> 05:12.830
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

05:12.960 --> 05:16.460
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

05:18.580 --> 05:20.710
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

05:20.790 --> 05:24.590
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

05:22.190 --> 05:23.060
Xixiaoao.

05:24.670 --> 05:26.380
-Mr. Lu is looking for you.
-What's up?

05:26.380 --> 05:27.610
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

05:27.350 --> 05:28.200
I don't want to go.

05:27.640 --> 05:30.420
♪ This mud all over me ♪

05:28.780 --> 05:30.350
Mr. Lu Sr. is here too.

05:31.330 --> 05:34.280
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

05:33.930 --> 05:34.800
You should go.

05:49.120 --> 05:50.250
I'll do it myself.

05:50.320 --> 05:50.909
It's fine.

05:50.909 --> 05:51.640
Thank you.

05:57.890 --> 05:59.020
Alright, Miss Zhou.

06:00.590 --> 06:02.320
Although Mrs. Lu had been accomplished

06:02.320 --> 06:04.150
in the art world during her lifetime,

06:04.150 --> 06:05.230
I think

06:05.230 --> 06:06.440
what truly makes her blessed

06:06.440 --> 06:07.440
is how Mr. Lu has kept

06:07.440 --> 06:09.300
her memory alive all these years.

06:09.320 --> 06:09.910
Yeah.

06:10.120 --> 06:11.440
This painting of hers

06:11.440 --> 06:12.710
would fetch a fortune

06:12.710 --> 06:14.200
at auction, wouldn't it?

06:14.590 --> 06:15.440
Seriously,

06:15.880 --> 06:17.030
Mr. Lu's devotion

06:17.200 --> 06:18.530
is worth more than gold.

06:19.000 --> 06:19.910
Thank you.

06:21.520 --> 06:22.080
Qilan.

06:22.440 --> 06:23.120
Look at you.

06:23.760 --> 06:25.030
You've got some nerve,

06:25.470 --> 06:26.440
coming back

06:26.440 --> 06:27.100
from abroad

06:27.390 --> 06:29.340
without telling your family.

06:30.320 --> 06:31.250
I'm telling you.

06:31.560 --> 06:32.620
Since you're back,

06:32.659 --> 06:34.440
get along well with your brother.

06:34.440 --> 06:35.440
Nothing compares to

06:35.440 --> 06:37.440
the family being happily together.

06:41.020 --> 06:41.700
Xixiao.

06:42.000 --> 06:42.600
As for you,

06:43.320 --> 06:44.560
what's your plan

06:44.560 --> 06:47.090
-for college?
-I'll fill you in on that later.

06:49.080 --> 06:50.590
You really make me worry.

06:59.000 --> 07:00.120
Dad, you go inside first.

07:00.120 --> 07:01.250
I'll follow in a bit.

07:07.590 --> 07:08.640
Why are you here

07:08.640 --> 07:10.040
at this kind of occasion?

07:10.120 --> 07:10.880
Didn't you also come all the way

07:10.880 --> 07:12.080
back from abroad?

07:12.200 --> 07:13.880
I came back to watch the show.

07:14.120 --> 07:15.350
Are you staying

07:15.470 --> 07:16.080
because you're interested

07:16.080 --> 07:17.740
in your dad's vanity project?

07:17.960 --> 07:18.960
I went through all that trouble

07:18.960 --> 07:19.440
to get your paperwork done

07:19.440 --> 07:20.770
behind your dad's back.

07:21.560 --> 07:22.230
Qilan?

07:22.640 --> 07:23.200
Coming.

07:23.320 --> 07:24.150
I'm going in.

07:27.930 --> 07:28.520
Xixiao.

07:29.230 --> 07:29.830
Come here.

07:37.590 --> 07:39.260
Just now outside,

07:39.470 --> 07:41.000
did you get into an argument

07:41.000 --> 07:42.000
with Mr. He's son?

07:47.230 --> 07:48.830
Go over and apologize to him.

07:49.830 --> 07:50.520
Okay?

07:50.909 --> 07:52.040
You know what I mean.

07:57.470 --> 07:58.680
It's no big deal.

08:01.910 --> 08:03.110
Isn't this Lu Xixiao?

08:04.500 --> 08:05.500
Are you yielding?

08:05.560 --> 08:06.620
Admitting defeat?

08:11.000 --> 08:11.710
I was wrong.

08:13.390 --> 08:14.390
What did you say?

08:14.780 --> 08:15.710
I can't hear you.

08:17.320 --> 08:18.680
I was wrong.

08:19.760 --> 08:21.220
What were you wrong about?

08:22.680 --> 08:23.680
I was wrong for...

08:24.590 --> 08:25.200
stopping you

08:25.200 --> 08:26.030
when you ran the red light,

08:26.030 --> 08:27.000
preventing you

08:27.370 --> 08:28.800
from hitting someone

08:28.910 --> 08:30.030
and breaking the law,

08:30.030 --> 08:31.230
and saving your life.

08:31.230 --> 08:32.320
I was wrong to agree to

08:32.320 --> 08:34.400
race you when you asked,

08:35.510 --> 08:36.830
letting you lose the race
in front of everyone

08:36.830 --> 08:38.429
because of your poor skills.

08:40.330 --> 08:41.659
You scratched my car,

08:42.440 --> 08:42.919
and I shouldn't have

08:42.919 --> 08:44.230
just smashed yours.

08:45.510 --> 08:46.230
I should have followed the process

08:46.230 --> 08:48.490
and asked your family for compensation.

08:49.920 --> 08:50.590
Then we'll see

08:50.590 --> 08:52.120
who should be apologizing,

08:52.400 --> 08:53.810
me or you, He Wenhui.

08:55.590 --> 08:56.230
Lu Xixiao.

08:56.900 --> 08:57.910
Can't you speak nicely?

08:57.910 --> 08:59.370
Is that how you apologize?

09:05.640 --> 09:06.820
Just putting on a show.

09:06.820 --> 09:08.000
That's enough.

09:09.760 --> 09:11.200
It's just a little friction

09:11.200 --> 09:12.710
between our dads over business.

09:12.710 --> 09:13.280
Now both of them

09:13.280 --> 09:15.110
are in a somewhat awkward position.

09:15.110 --> 09:16.470
They're using us as an excuse

09:16.470 --> 09:17.990
to talk again.

09:25.590 --> 09:26.320
Can't you see

09:26.320 --> 09:27.230
the situation?

09:28.110 --> 09:30.170
You really think I came to apologize?

09:31.470 --> 09:32.160
Get lost.

09:32.190 --> 09:33.160
Go away.

09:43.990 --> 09:45.130
See? Aren't they getting along fine?

09:45.130 --> 09:45.960
Come on.

09:50.460 --> 09:52.130
If you keep making a fuss,

09:53.650 --> 09:54.680
who do you think

09:54.680 --> 09:56.150
will look worse—

09:56.280 --> 09:56.710
you in your dad's eyes,

09:56.710 --> 09:58.040
or me in mine?

10:08.620 --> 10:10.280
You're not any better than me.

10:10.340 --> 10:11.500
We're the same,

10:11.770 --> 10:13.300
playing the good kids here.

10:15.130 --> 10:16.570
We're not the same.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.060
I've asked around.

10:20.920 --> 10:23.920
He Wenhui, you aren't afraid of anyone—

10:24.260 --> 10:25.280
except your dad.

10:28.360 --> 10:29.270
I'm not afraid.

10:35.100 --> 10:35.790
Fine.

10:36.920 --> 10:38.180
Since that's the case,

10:38.180 --> 10:38.870
why are you still

10:38.870 --> 10:39.790
putting on this act here?

10:39.790 --> 10:40.790
What's the point?

10:41.940 --> 10:43.500
It's all for a painting.

10:47.350 --> 10:48.630
I'll settle the score

10:49.220 --> 10:50.620
with Luo He another time.

10:51.350 --> 10:52.040
Get lost.

10:52.170 --> 10:53.250
Don't touch me.

10:53.400 --> 10:54.010
I can walk.

11:07.340 --> 11:10.110
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

11:11.180 --> 11:13.030
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

11:13.640 --> 11:16.480
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

11:18.050 --> 11:19.680
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

11:21.280 --> 11:24.350
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

11:25.170 --> 11:28.570
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

11:30.710 --> 11:32.110
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

11:32.140 --> 11:33.660
♪ That I can fly ♪

11:35.940 --> 11:36.780
♪ Long time no see ♪

11:36.850 --> 11:38.140
♪ You haven't been here ♪

11:39.300 --> 11:41.800
♪ Stop watch has seen the changes ♪

11:42.480 --> 11:44.420
♪ I'm sure you won't forget ♪

11:44.450 --> 11:46.230
♪ The door you ever knocked ♪

11:47.970 --> 11:50.090
♪ So I sent you a clock ♪

11:50.120 --> 11:51.820
♪ To recover the deadlock ♪

11:53.140 --> 11:55.120
♪ It's like I'm losing my sword ♪

11:54.110 --> 11:55.840
Did he cause you trouble again?

11:56.410 --> 11:59.250
♪ Chop off the line
between the loving core ♪

12:01.930 --> 12:04.380
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

12:04.350 --> 12:05.470
Did he bother you?

12:06.010 --> 12:07.560
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

12:08.410 --> 12:09.470
So beautiful.

12:08.970 --> 12:11.140
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

12:12.900 --> 12:14.530
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

12:15.650 --> 12:18.900
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

12:17.410 --> 12:18.080
Thank you.

12:20.190 --> 12:23.280
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

12:25.530 --> 12:27.620
♪ Nescience doesn't mean that I can fly ♪

12:31.240 --> 12:33.120
♪ But I never seem to close ♪

12:33.180 --> 12:35.140
♪ The dormer lock ♪

12:33.410 --> 12:35.010
As expected of the Lu family,

12:35.160 --> 12:36.980
inviting so many distinguished guests

12:36.980 --> 12:38.310
to put on such a grand event.

12:38.040 --> 12:40.480
♪ Tell you starts were above the floor ♪

12:38.750 --> 12:40.230
You must've put a lot of effort into this.

12:40.230 --> 12:41.830
I just helped out a bit.

12:42.630 --> 12:44.490
Looks like it won't be long before

12:44.590 --> 12:45.710
we officially address you

12:45.710 --> 12:46.470
as Mrs. Lu.

12:47.320 --> 12:48.110
Thank you.

12:48.110 --> 12:48.880
Cheers.

12:50.510 --> 12:51.970
We just came out like this?

12:52.280 --> 12:54.080
What's there to stay for inside?

12:54.200 --> 12:56.530
I've arranged something for you out here.

13:02.590 --> 13:03.320
How is it?

13:04.350 --> 13:05.810
Didn't you want to hear it?

13:05.960 --> 13:07.360
I arranged a solo for you.

13:09.080 --> 13:10.280
This is too extravagant.

13:10.280 --> 13:10.990
They had a performance

13:10.990 --> 13:12.520
scheduled tonight anyway,

13:13.200 --> 13:14.560
but the song you want

13:14.560 --> 13:15.820
wasn't on the setlist.

13:16.280 --> 13:18.340
I didn't want you to come for nothing.

13:21.760 --> 13:22.440
Thank you.

13:22.460 --> 13:23.110
Come.

13:27.550 --> 13:28.350
Can you dance?

13:33.230 --> 13:34.090
I'll teach you.

13:37.010 --> 13:37.580
Come on.

14:00.220 --> 14:00.950
Take it slow.

14:01.020 --> 14:01.950
Follow my steps.

14:16.530 --> 14:17.780
It's a bit hard.

14:17.340 --> 14:23.190
♪ The narcissus rides a carp,
drifting away in sadness ♪

14:18.100 --> 14:18.830
Take it slow.

14:24.450 --> 14:30.000
♪ Deep green lurks beneath the sea,
stirring the nebula ♪

14:28.230 --> 14:29.230
Do you know why

14:29.230 --> 14:31.360
they aren't playing this piece today?

14:31.400 --> 14:32.730
This song

14:31.720 --> 14:37.550
♪ On countless nights, we move forward ♪

14:32.760 --> 14:34.640
tells a love story, right?

14:35.680 --> 14:38.280
Maybe they thought
it didn't fit the occasion?

14:39.230 --> 14:41.160
♪ Seeking, waking up and collecting ♪

14:39.870 --> 14:40.930
The story goes that

14:41.200 --> 14:41.960
two people who shouldn't

14:41.960 --> 14:43.460
be together

14:42.900 --> 14:44.620
♪ Crazy love ♪

14:43.510 --> 14:45.400
met and still fell in love.

14:45.990 --> 14:50.420
♪ Say yes, let's start fresh ♪

14:46.590 --> 14:47.710
The woman eventually hurt

14:47.710 --> 14:49.310
the man who deeply loved her.

14:49.800 --> 14:50.750
But this man

14:50.920 --> 14:52.440
still tried to protect her

14:52.540 --> 14:53.610
and died.

14:53.300 --> 14:55.570
♪ The first night, my sunset ♪

14:54.040 --> 14:54.990
How foolish.

14:55.590 --> 14:56.140
No.

14:56.200 --> 14:59.130
♪ The whole world, the two of us♪

14:56.850 --> 14:58.250
I watched the interview.

14:58.320 --> 14:58.990
The composer said

14:58.990 --> 15:00.320
that in the story, the man believed

14:59.790 --> 15:02.910
♪ The city doesn't sleep, ups and downs ♪

15:00.320 --> 15:02.230
until the very end that it was fate—

15:02.230 --> 15:03.550
even if it was a wrong fate.

15:03.500 --> 15:06.720
♪ Breathing at midnight ♪

15:07.650 --> 15:10.020
♪ Someone lights the fire ♪

15:10.900 --> 15:14.240
♪ The love burns each other ♪

15:14.350 --> 15:17.270
♪ My organs ♪

15:17.420 --> 15:20.780
♪ Every midnight ♪

15:20.960 --> 15:23.370
♪ Being played ♪

15:36.950 --> 15:38.330
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

15:39.740 --> 15:42.020
♪ Let's dance ♪

15:44.510 --> 15:45.490
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

15:46.550 --> 15:49.280
♪ Follow your steps ♪

15:51.320 --> 15:53.590
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

15:53.690 --> 15:56.480
♪ Close my eyes and count ♪

15:58.450 --> 16:00.360
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

16:00.530 --> 16:04.160
♪ Open your eyes and see me ♪

16:05.680 --> 16:07.070
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

16:08.480 --> 16:11.070
♪ Let's dance ♪

16:13.080 --> 16:14.380
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

16:15.280 --> 16:18.600
♪ Follow your steps ♪

16:20.060 --> 16:22.330
♪ One, two, three, four, five ♪

16:22.430 --> 16:25.380
♪ Close my eyes and count ♪

16:43.430 --> 16:44.370
You dance well.

17:00.590 --> 17:02.230
Before it actually happens,

17:03.230 --> 17:04.790
it's still not too late

17:05.200 --> 17:06.470
for me to stop, right?

17:07.230 --> 17:09.020
If one day I hurt you,

17:09.119 --> 17:10.119
what would you do?

17:15.500 --> 17:16.359
Nothing.

17:26.900 --> 17:27.790
Hello, everyone.

17:27.790 --> 17:29.360
Welcome, all guests,

17:29.360 --> 17:31.750
to my house.

17:32.680 --> 17:34.470
Today is Lanyue Group's

17:34.680 --> 17:36.990
40th anniversary celebration.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.040
Thank you.

17:41.880 --> 17:43.310
Speaking of Lanyue Group,

17:43.310 --> 17:44.790
I believe many of you here

17:45.120 --> 17:46.600
are our partners.

17:47.310 --> 17:49.120
You have developed

17:49.310 --> 17:50.310
and grown with us.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.710
The man standing on the left off stage

17:52.710 --> 17:53.750
is my father.

17:54.840 --> 17:55.710
Lanyue Group

17:55.790 --> 17:57.160
was painstakingly

17:57.360 --> 17:58.710
built by him

17:58.960 --> 18:00.400
from the ground up.

18:01.270 --> 18:02.650
So the responsibility on me

18:02.650 --> 18:04.320
is even greater.

18:05.120 --> 18:06.030
Well, now,

18:06.240 --> 18:07.470
everyone, please look at

18:07.470 --> 18:08.640
this painting behind me.

18:08.640 --> 18:09.360
This painting

18:09.360 --> 18:11.360
is a very important work

18:11.360 --> 18:13.070
by my son Xixiao's

18:13.070 --> 18:13.960
late mother.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.440
It's also a piece I have

18:16.840 --> 18:17.960
treasured for many years.

18:17.960 --> 18:18.510
Let's go

18:19.550 --> 18:20.470
somewhere

18:21.140 --> 18:22.800
without people we don't like.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.920
The name of this work is

18:26.230 --> 18:27.030
"Midsummer".

18:29.850 --> 18:31.510
It's "Never-Ending Summer".

18:36.290 --> 18:37.550
Wait here for a second.

18:41.030 --> 18:42.030
And this is not a

18:42.030 --> 18:42.960
single piece.

18:44.540 --> 18:45.820
It's a series.

19:01.580 --> 19:02.770
Hello, Dr. Chen?

19:02.940 --> 19:03.900
I have good news.

19:04.070 --> 19:05.030
Your grandma's test results

19:05.030 --> 19:05.550
are out.

19:05.710 --> 19:07.120
Her indicators are quite ideal.

19:07.120 --> 19:08.680
If a matching kidney is found,

19:08.680 --> 19:10.200
surgery can be considered.

19:10.200 --> 19:10.960
Really?

19:11.400 --> 19:12.270
This series

19:12.270 --> 19:13.550
includes four works:

19:13.990 --> 19:17.890
Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter.

19:18.230 --> 19:19.830
When can the surgery be done?

19:20.400 --> 19:21.120
The surgery has to wait

19:21.120 --> 19:22.550
for a matching kidney donor.

19:22.550 --> 19:23.790
But regarding the cost,

19:23.790 --> 19:25.650
you need to be mentally prepared.

19:26.920 --> 19:28.050
How much is the cost?

19:28.210 --> 19:28.860
300,000.

19:28.920 --> 19:29.480
Hello,

19:29.580 --> 19:31.240
please show your invitation.

19:33.530 --> 19:36.350
I was invited by the Lu family.

19:37.500 --> 19:39.470
Mrs. Lu said she doesn't know you.

19:40.120 --> 19:41.200
To be continued.

19:43.200 --> 19:45.460
The passion and bravery in this painting

19:45.470 --> 19:47.530
are the most moving things about her.

19:48.030 --> 19:48.590
Zhou Wan?

19:49.480 --> 19:51.070
When do I need to pay?

19:51.880 --> 19:52.790
The artwork "Never-Ending Summer"

19:52.790 --> 19:54.190
represents her lifetime

19:55.880 --> 19:57.550
passion in the world.

19:58.340 --> 19:59.750
If you don't have an invitation,

19:59.750 --> 20:01.410
we'll have to ask you to leave.

20:01.710 --> 20:03.020
Once a kidney donor matches,

20:03.020 --> 20:04.160
surgery must be done immediately.

20:04.160 --> 20:05.420
The sooner the better.

20:06.930 --> 20:08.200
If you still don't cooperate,

20:08.200 --> 20:09.400
then we'll have to...

20:17.490 --> 20:18.260
Excuse me,

20:18.870 --> 20:19.830
everyone.

20:22.440 --> 20:23.160
I came here

20:23.200 --> 20:24.230
to find someone.

20:25.400 --> 20:26.440
Many of you here probably

20:26.440 --> 20:27.200
know her.

20:28.030 --> 20:28.750
She is the hostess

20:28.750 --> 20:29.990
of this banquet,

20:30.640 --> 20:32.640
Ms. Guo Xiangling.

20:32.680 --> 20:33.270
You.

20:33.270 --> 20:35.070
-Looking for you.
-Looking for you.

20:35.070 --> 20:35.870
Or perhaps,

20:37.360 --> 20:39.040
I should call you...

20:40.680 --> 20:41.230
Mom.

20:41.580 --> 20:42.230
Mom?

20:42.260 --> 20:43.510
-Mom?
-Mom?

20:43.630 --> 20:44.990
T-This... She...

20:45.010 --> 20:46.640
She has a daughter?

20:46.960 --> 20:47.850
What did I say?

20:47.880 --> 20:48.470
Your father's event

20:48.470 --> 20:49.730
always has some drama.

20:54.220 --> 20:55.280
My name is Zhou Wan.

20:55.680 --> 20:57.940
"Wan" as in drawing
a bow like a full moon.

20:58.070 --> 21:00.200
I'm a student at Yangming High School.

21:01.230 --> 21:02.830
My father passed away early.

21:02.880 --> 21:03.940
Since I was little,

21:04.270 --> 21:06.470
I've never experienced motherly love.

21:07.320 --> 21:09.640
My family's condition isn't good either.

21:09.640 --> 21:11.840
It's hard to maintain our current life.

21:14.140 --> 21:15.010
For all of this,

21:15.720 --> 21:17.620
I want to thank Ms. Guo Xiangling.

21:20.160 --> 21:21.320
Without her,

21:22.360 --> 21:23.890
I wouldn't be who I am today.

21:27.880 --> 21:28.880
I want to thank her

21:29.600 --> 21:30.200
for...

21:30.200 --> 21:30.920
Zhou Wan.

21:35.400 --> 21:38.790
Ms. Guo, thank you for
supporting my studies

21:39.190 --> 21:41.630
anonymously all these years.

21:42.640 --> 21:44.410
I'm grateful for her kindness.

21:45.270 --> 21:45.960
I'd even say

21:47.750 --> 21:49.520
she means more to me than

21:50.070 --> 21:51.030
my own mother.

21:54.440 --> 21:56.470
Come on. Go on up.

21:56.470 --> 21:57.200
No.

22:12.270 --> 22:13.600
What are you doing here?

22:14.030 --> 22:15.630
Didn't I make it clear to you?

22:18.030 --> 22:18.710
My dad's insurance money

22:18.710 --> 22:19.880
belongs to me in the first place.

22:19.880 --> 22:20.640
300,000.

22:21.190 --> 22:23.050
Grandma needs it for her surgery.

22:26.600 --> 22:27.460
Say something.

22:30.170 --> 22:32.000
Thank you. Thank you all.

22:33.200 --> 22:34.990
This is truly unexpected.

22:37.030 --> 22:38.270
I never thought

22:38.550 --> 22:39.960
you'd come find me here.

22:41.070 --> 22:42.070
But...

22:43.120 --> 22:44.460
I'm truly touched.

22:44.510 --> 22:45.310
Thank you all.

22:51.790 --> 22:52.550
I know

22:52.840 --> 22:54.700
my actions today are a bit abrupt.

22:55.510 --> 22:56.970
I hope you'll understand.

22:57.500 --> 22:58.380
I came here

22:58.600 --> 22:59.800
just to tell everyone

23:01.070 --> 23:02.600
that over the years, Ms. Guo

23:03.030 --> 23:04.620
has had a very hard time.

23:05.070 --> 23:06.880
She's a very kind

23:07.640 --> 23:09.270
and warm-hearted lady.

23:10.880 --> 23:11.600
And it's precisely because of

23:11.600 --> 23:13.030
her kindness and warmth

23:15.020 --> 23:17.830
that I gathered the courage to stand here.

23:18.960 --> 23:19.710
I think there's no

23:19.710 --> 23:20.970
better place than this

23:21.400 --> 23:23.070
to show everyone

23:23.360 --> 23:25.420
my gratitude to her.

23:31.240 --> 23:32.840
If you want to ruin yourself,

23:33.350 --> 23:34.880
don't drag me down with you.

23:38.510 --> 23:39.370
Get up quickly.

23:39.980 --> 23:42.180
-Then finish this show with me.
-Get up.

23:44.120 --> 23:44.600
Mom.

23:49.470 --> 23:51.710
Today is truly such a surprise,

23:51.790 --> 23:52.850
and I'm so touched.

23:53.960 --> 23:55.550
Actually, I never thought

23:55.550 --> 23:57.010
about getting any return.

23:57.430 --> 23:58.540
I only hope

23:59.990 --> 24:01.710
you have a bright future

24:02.680 --> 24:03.890
and a beautiful life.

24:04.750 --> 24:05.350
Thank you.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.820
Dear visitors,

24:20.030 --> 24:21.220
Pingchuan Art Museum

24:21.220 --> 24:23.350
is now officially closed

24:23.600 --> 24:24.960
for the day.

24:24.860 --> 24:31.640
[Pingchuan Art Museum]

24:25.440 --> 24:26.880
If you are still inside,

24:26.960 --> 24:28.790
please take your belongings

24:29.000 --> 24:30.750
and follow the staff's guidance

24:30.750 --> 24:31.850
to exit in an orderly manner.

24:31.850 --> 24:36.100
[Joint Exhibition of Famous Artists]

24:32.120 --> 24:33.310
During your departure,

24:33.310 --> 24:34.990
please watch your step

24:35.120 --> 24:36.250
and avoid crowding.

24:45.840 --> 24:46.600
Jiang Yan.

24:46.830 --> 24:47.360
Grandma.

24:47.360 --> 24:48.690
Why are you here so late?

24:50.160 --> 24:51.290
Is Zhou Wan not here?

24:51.550 --> 24:52.310
No.

24:52.310 --> 24:53.310
She brought me lunch at noon

24:53.310 --> 24:54.990
and left, saying she had things to do.

24:54.990 --> 24:55.440
Why?

24:56.310 --> 24:57.350
Is Wan okay?

24:58.070 --> 24:58.750
She's fine.

24:59.160 --> 25:00.360
Maybe her phone died.

25:01.710 --> 25:04.070
I won't disturb your rest then.

25:04.670 --> 25:05.730
Are you going back?

25:05.840 --> 25:06.640
Wait a moment.

25:07.200 --> 25:08.160
Please do me a favor

25:08.160 --> 25:09.920
and take this lunchbox back for me.

25:09.920 --> 25:10.550
Alright?

25:11.600 --> 25:12.200
Besides,

25:13.640 --> 25:14.960
there's something inside the bag.

25:14.960 --> 25:16.230
I don't know what it is,

25:17.120 --> 25:18.270
but it looks quite formal.

25:18.270 --> 25:19.200
Take it back too.

25:24.200 --> 25:27.530
[Invitation]

25:27.560 --> 25:30.090
[Lu Zhongyue]

25:30.120 --> 25:31.510
Lu Family Banquet?

25:36.920 --> 25:39.200
Zhou Wan, what exactly is

25:39.590 --> 25:41.520
your relationship with Lu Xixiao?

25:52.310 --> 25:53.070
Zhou Wan.

25:55.120 --> 25:55.880
You asked me this afternoon

25:55.880 --> 25:57.360
if you ever hurt me one day,

25:57.360 --> 25:58.310
what I would do.

26:00.360 --> 26:01.510
You already knew what you were

26:01.510 --> 26:02.840
going to do, didn't you?

26:09.470 --> 26:10.870
So let me answer you now.

26:12.730 --> 26:14.930
You've always known better than anyone

26:14.990 --> 26:16.140
how to hurt me.

26:19.790 --> 26:20.510
Lu Xixiao...

26:20.510 --> 26:22.310
Didn't you say you were leaving?

27:07.120 --> 27:08.900
Zhou Wan, I know you too well.

27:11.160 --> 27:12.070
What you said

27:12.070 --> 27:13.400
at the banquet just now,

27:13.470 --> 27:15.400
what between you and that woman...

27:15.790 --> 27:16.920
You just wanted to use me

27:16.920 --> 27:17.620
to get close to her.

27:17.620 --> 27:18.380
Didn't you?

27:21.430 --> 27:22.470
Did you think I would

27:22.470 --> 27:23.670
believe those words?

27:27.590 --> 27:29.010
You approached me

27:30.550 --> 27:32.150
and slowly made me trust you.

27:33.270 --> 27:34.530
You slowly made me feel

27:34.840 --> 27:35.550
like this world

27:35.550 --> 27:36.640
wasn't that bad.

27:37.250 --> 27:37.900
Why?

27:44.310 --> 27:45.880
Turn around and look at me!

27:55.100 --> 27:56.140
I'm sorry.

28:05.450 --> 28:07.910
Do you really want
to be my sister that badly?

28:44.570 --> 28:49.000
♪ Should I chase freedom all alone ♪

28:49.970 --> 28:52.770
♪ Find an excuse, heed what I've known ♪

28:54.440 --> 28:57.200
♪ Every time I stop and stay ♪

28:57.220 --> 28:59.280
♪ For reasons that fade away ♪

29:01.120 --> 29:04.760
♪ Are you out there waiting for me ♪

29:02.920 --> 29:04.030
In all the time we spent together,

29:04.030 --> 29:05.290
was there ever a moment

29:06.500 --> 29:09.150
♪ Through the dark, bravely, steadily ♪

29:06.790 --> 29:08.320
when you actually liked me?

29:10.170 --> 29:13.760
♪ If I could run and land with you ♪

29:15.650 --> 29:17.270
I never thought about it.

29:16.140 --> 29:19.430
♪ After the long night ♪

29:20.880 --> 29:22.820
♪ I'll find my way, no more lost inside ♪

29:23.940 --> 29:27.010
♪ Thinking about ♪

29:28.720 --> 29:32.260
♪ Fulfilling the last promise ♪

29:34.600 --> 29:36.140
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

29:36.630 --> 29:37.850
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

29:38.130 --> 29:41.030
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

29:42.350 --> 29:44.390
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

29:44.510 --> 29:48.550
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

29:49.840 --> 29:51.530
♪ In this boring universe ♪

29:51.580 --> 29:53.120
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

29:53.260 --> 29:57.450
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

29:57.670 --> 29:58.880
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

30:00.090 --> 30:03.530
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

30:04.990 --> 30:07.720
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

30:21.850 --> 30:25.140
♪ After the long night ♪

30:26.590 --> 30:28.600
♪ I'll find my way, no more lost inside ♪

30:29.640 --> 30:32.710
♪ Thinking about ♪

30:34.420 --> 30:37.960
♪ Fulfilling the last promise ♪

30:40.310 --> 30:42.280
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

30:42.340 --> 30:43.730
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

30:43.830 --> 30:47.150
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

30:48.050 --> 30:50.280
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

30:50.380 --> 30:54.390
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

30:55.540 --> 30:57.230
♪ In this boring universe ♪

30:57.290 --> 30:58.910
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

30:59.140 --> 31:03.190
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

31:03.370 --> 31:04.950
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

31:05.800 --> 31:09.360
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

31:10.700 --> 31:13.370
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

31:24.920 --> 31:25.880
Not everyone

31:25.880 --> 31:27.440
can be Cinderella.

31:28.610 --> 31:30.700
Only you know

31:30.960 --> 31:32.120
if the shoe fits.

31:39.030 --> 31:40.230
What are you here for?

31:41.990 --> 31:43.470
Xixiao's aunt invites you

31:43.470 --> 31:45.120
to breakfast tomorrow.

31:45.680 --> 31:47.140
Since you've made a scene,

31:47.160 --> 31:48.690
there has to be a follow-up.

31:51.630 --> 31:52.430
I'm not going.

31:55.270 --> 31:55.940
What?

31:57.160 --> 31:59.120
Is Lu Xixiao mad at you?

32:06.120 --> 32:07.380
I thought you came to me

32:07.710 --> 32:09.230
to talk about money.

32:10.440 --> 32:12.270
Anything else, forget it.

32:14.640 --> 32:16.310
You should've
thought about the consequences

32:16.310 --> 32:17.970
when you went crazy like that.

32:22.880 --> 32:24.880
As long as you can pay the money back,

32:25.360 --> 32:27.470
I don't care about the consequences.

32:28.550 --> 32:29.140
Fine.

32:31.200 --> 32:33.110
Let's put on a good show then.

32:34.310 --> 32:35.030
Tomorrow,

32:36.200 --> 32:38.360
you will do whatever I say.

32:39.370 --> 32:40.900
You'll say that from now on,

32:41.030 --> 32:42.420
you're leaving Pingchuan

32:42.420 --> 32:43.890
and never coming back.

32:44.310 --> 32:45.310
If you can do that,

32:45.820 --> 32:47.150
I'll give you the money.

32:54.960 --> 32:56.480
Why should I believe you?

32:57.710 --> 32:59.370
You still owe me that 300,000.

33:08.720 --> 33:10.010
I can go.

33:10.470 --> 33:12.160
But Grandma's follow-up dialysis

33:12.160 --> 33:12.920
costs 6,000.

33:13.170 --> 33:14.830
You have to give me that first.

33:18.850 --> 33:19.610
6,000?

33:25.160 --> 33:26.290
Starting tomorrow,

33:26.360 --> 33:28.400
stay out of my sight.

33:28.880 --> 33:29.440
Okay?

34:05.960 --> 34:06.840
She is...

34:10.750 --> 34:11.560
Guo Yan.

34:12.360 --> 34:12.989
My mom.

34:39.989 --> 34:40.639
Thanks.

34:56.340 --> 34:58.180
You must have a lot of questions.

35:01.190 --> 35:03.120
It's okay if you don't want to talk.

35:07.500 --> 35:08.900
After my dad passed away,

35:10.550 --> 35:11.670
she left.

35:14.880 --> 35:18.280
And she never came back.

35:20.510 --> 35:21.590
When she left,

35:22.510 --> 35:24.110
she took all the money we had.

35:27.920 --> 35:28.760
That could be

35:28.760 --> 35:30.620
Grandma's lifesaving money now.

35:32.730 --> 35:33.730
She told me

35:34.440 --> 35:36.170
she didn't have it easy either,

35:38.190 --> 35:39.590
saying she was very poor.

35:41.760 --> 35:42.960
But you saw the truth.

35:46.170 --> 35:47.450
So,

35:48.960 --> 35:50.070
is she the reason

35:50.070 --> 35:51.530
you got close to Lu Xixiao?

35:54.800 --> 35:55.840
If I said yes,

35:57.720 --> 35:58.400
would you also think

35:58.400 --> 35:59.400
I'm a bad person?

36:01.960 --> 36:02.760
Also?

36:05.110 --> 36:07.110
Who else thinks you're a bad person?

36:26.920 --> 36:27.550
Zhou Wan,

36:27.840 --> 36:29.170
you're not a bad person.

36:30.050 --> 36:31.510
Maybe others don't get it,

36:31.810 --> 36:32.730
but I do.

36:33.730 --> 36:35.250
No one would want anything

36:35.990 --> 36:36.840
to do with

36:38.240 --> 36:39.280
someone who

36:39.920 --> 36:41.110
abandoned them unless they

36:41.110 --> 36:42.240
had no other choice.

36:45.760 --> 36:47.070
I'll keep your secret.

36:47.670 --> 36:49.200
Just like when we were kids.

36:57.150 --> 36:57.630
Thanks.

37:10.440 --> 37:11.440
I didn't tell him.

37:12.360 --> 37:12.990
Xixiao,

37:14.280 --> 37:16.300
what's your plan

37:16.400 --> 37:17.440
for college?

37:18.150 --> 37:19.110
I thought Auntie

37:19.110 --> 37:20.190
already told you.

37:20.670 --> 37:21.840
She's been busy and hasn't

37:21.840 --> 37:22.700
had the chance.

37:22.880 --> 37:23.280
Come.

37:23.470 --> 37:24.470
Since you're here,

37:24.470 --> 37:25.470
tell me yourself.

37:33.550 --> 37:34.510
I plan to

37:36.030 --> 37:37.070
study art abroad.

37:37.320 --> 37:39.180
I'll apply to my mom's alma mater.

37:40.720 --> 37:41.720
Study art?

37:42.840 --> 37:44.190
This is not a whim.

37:45.470 --> 37:47.440
I've already figured out what to study.

37:47.440 --> 37:48.030
I think college isn't

37:48.030 --> 37:49.470
something to take lightly,

37:49.470 --> 37:50.110
so I feel

37:50.110 --> 37:51.240
it's necessary to choose a

37:51.240 --> 37:52.640
major I'm interested in.

37:53.150 --> 37:53.760
Since I have

37:53.760 --> 37:54.960
decided to stay now,

37:55.550 --> 37:57.030
I'll spend a year properly preparing

37:57.030 --> 37:58.430
and applying seriously.

37:59.070 --> 38:00.990
Why haven't you mentioned this before?

38:00.990 --> 38:02.150
Why do you want

38:02.190 --> 38:03.590
to study art all of a sudden?

38:03.590 --> 38:05.650
That's just because you didn't know.

38:13.800 --> 38:14.660
Dad, Zhongyue.

38:14.840 --> 38:15.630
Here's the thing.

38:15.630 --> 38:17.280
When Xixiao first told me,

38:17.280 --> 38:18.470
I didn't believe him either.

38:18.470 --> 38:19.470
But then he showed me

38:19.470 --> 38:20.440
his portfolio.

38:20.440 --> 38:20.960
And I remembered

38:20.960 --> 38:22.990
that when he was little, he did

38:22.990 --> 38:24.590
take art classes for a while.

38:24.920 --> 38:27.070
So I thought it was worth a shot.

38:32.290 --> 38:33.730
It wasn't long,

38:33.760 --> 38:35.760
but I did take art lessons

38:35.760 --> 38:37.240
when I was little.

38:37.880 --> 38:39.110
And that's when

38:39.110 --> 38:40.400
I started thinking...

38:40.670 --> 38:42.760
What you think and what you do

38:42.760 --> 38:43.630
are two different things.

38:43.630 --> 38:44.360
You know?

38:50.880 --> 38:52.340
You act like you're so into

38:53.190 --> 38:54.720
art all the time, don't you?

38:56.190 --> 38:57.300
How dare you!

38:58.960 --> 38:59.590
Alright.

38:59.800 --> 39:01.030
Alright, alright, alright.

39:01.030 --> 39:02.550
Come on, don't be mad.

39:02.720 --> 39:04.440
Sit down. Just sit down.

39:07.590 --> 39:09.720
Your dad isn't really mad.

39:10.320 --> 39:11.880
He just thinks you could

39:12.030 --> 39:13.520
study painting anytime.

39:13.800 --> 39:14.440
Look,

39:14.720 --> 39:16.840
you're about to go abroad
to study finance.

39:16.840 --> 39:18.440
You're leaving this summer.

39:18.590 --> 39:19.720
When you come back,

39:19.720 --> 39:21.240
you can study whatever you want,

39:21.240 --> 39:22.630
play whatever you want.

39:22.760 --> 39:23.550
Isn't that great?

39:23.550 --> 39:25.150
I've already made up my mind.

39:28.160 --> 39:33.140
[The guest is here.]

39:32.510 --> 39:33.510
Our guest is here.

39:33.550 --> 39:34.440
No fighting in front of

39:34.440 --> 39:35.400
the guest, okay?

39:45.070 --> 39:45.990
Zhou Wan,

39:46.360 --> 39:47.360
you finally came.

39:47.510 --> 39:49.640
You didn't stay for dinner yesterday.

39:50.400 --> 39:51.550
Mrs. Lu, well,

39:51.550 --> 39:52.400
you did something good

39:52.400 --> 39:54.000
and didn't even take credit.

39:55.920 --> 39:57.280
Am I not supposed to

39:57.280 --> 39:58.590
call you Mrs. Lu yet?

39:59.360 --> 40:00.320
You should.

40:00.630 --> 40:01.590
Why not?

40:02.440 --> 40:05.150
I've been waiting for you
to call me that for a long time.

40:05.150 --> 40:05.630
Come.

40:05.630 --> 40:06.670
Sit down and eat.

40:06.990 --> 40:08.790
Another set of cutlery, please.

40:15.630 --> 40:16.560
Hello, Grandpa.

40:17.800 --> 40:18.630
Hello, Uncle.

40:20.530 --> 40:21.490
Hello, Aunt Guo.

40:28.550 --> 40:29.840
Why are you just standing there?

40:29.840 --> 40:31.150
Say hi to your brother.

40:39.400 --> 40:39.990
Hi, brother.
